    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-πεμπτέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that must be dismissed, rejected, inadmissible</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				31.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπεμπτέον</span>, <i>one must
			reject</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γραφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Adv.</u>
					195.8
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>one must omit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Hom.</u>
				p.60
			</span></i> O., <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must inject</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι τῇ ἕδρᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			.</div>
